    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d590">

                <pb facs="0709" n="699" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg699"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/8–2048</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chinese Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Koo</hi>)</head>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to His Excellency the Chinese
                    Ambassador and has the honor to refer to the Department’s Memorandum dated July
                    1, 1948, regarding the payment by the Chinese Government of the second
                    installment of principal and interest due on July 1, 1948, under the Lend-Lease
                    “Pipeline” agreement of June 14, 1946 in the amount of $2,824,930.75.</p>
                <p>It is understood that the Treasury Department has not yet received this payment,
                    and the Secretary of State will be appreciative of the cooperation of His
                    Excellency in this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-08-20">August 20,
                        1948</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
